    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49348" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tūbercŭlum</span></b> , i,
			n.
		dim.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				small swelling</i>, <i>bump</i>, or <i>protuberance; a boil</i>, <i>pimple</i>, <i>tubercle</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in gingivis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					6, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in capite,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 7,
				6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fabae,</span>”
				<i>an excrescence</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					22, 22, 45, § 91</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">11, 11, 12,
				§ 29</span></i>.</div>
